          "content": "To complete the reservation I\u2019ll need a few more details:\n\n1. **Your date of birth** (so I can add you as a passenger).  \n2. **The ID of the travel certificate** you\u2019d like to use for payment (e.g., `certificate_123456`).  \n3. **Seat\u2011preference confirmation** \u2013 I\u2019ll note \u201caisle\u201d for you and \u201cmiddle\u201d for Kevin, but seat assignment is confirmed at check\u2011in.  \n\nOnce I have that information I\u2019ll:\n\n* Search for the direct ORD\u202f\u2192\u202fPHL flight on\u202fMay\u202f26 that matches the schedule you flew on\u202fMay\u202f10.  \n* Check the total price for both passengers.  \n* If the total exceeds your $500 limit, I\u2019ll book only your ticket as you requested.  \n\nPlease provide the missing details so I can proceed.",
